 "words": 228,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Down by the Nile where the tall reeds grow",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A baby cried in a basket boat",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His sister stood at a distance",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To see what would happen to him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then his sister said to Pharaoh's daughter",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shall I go and find you a Hebrew woman to nurse the child for you",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Years of brick and straw and the whip upon the back",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Moses stretched out his hand and the sea rolled back",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Israelites walked through the sea on dry ground",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the LORD brought the waters of the sea back over them",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Miriam the prophetess, Aaron's sister",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Took a tambourine in her hand",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And all the women followed her",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With tambourines and dancing",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sing to the LORD, for he is highly exalted",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Horse and rider he hurled into the sea",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sing to the LORD, for he is highly exalted",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Horse and rider he hurled into the sea",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD is my strength and my song",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He has become my salvation",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is my God, and I will praise him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The God of my father, and I will exalt him",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
